    {
      "text": "It controls its water balloons with song. The melody is learned from others of its kind and is passed down from one generation to the next.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its singing voice is its chief weapon in battle. This Pokémon’s Trainer must prioritize the daily maintenance of its throat at all costs.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "To Primarina, every battle is a stage. It takes down its prey with beautiful singing and dancing.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Also known as a songstress, it has a fantastical look on moonlit nights when it leads its colony in song.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "With its mouth, it makes sonic waves that sound like beautiful singing. It uses the sonic waves to control its water balloons.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "For Primarina, every battle’s a stage. Its singing and the dancing of its balloons will mesmerize the audience.",
